ess roaming use of voice, video, and data applications; end-to-end collaboration solutions through cloud, on-premise, or within hybrid cloud environments. In addition, it offers technical support services. The company serves businesses, public institutions, governments, and service providers. It sells its products and services directly, through systems integrators, service providers, and resellers, and distributors. It has a collaboration with NVIDIA Corporation to develop Ultra-Dense Small Form Factor Pluggable (USFP), a high-density optical module pluggable transceiver. Cisco Systems, Inc. was incorporated in 1984 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","web":"https://www.cisco.com","empleados":82400.0,"precio_bloque":{"precio":95.63999938964844,"r1m":-0.1293582092112664,"r3m":-0.14959463418846752,"r6m":-0.18475640651030723,"r12m":0.3170715153104504,"ytd":0.27422589034363476,"r12m_spy":0.11578999824230274,"mom12_1":0.5127593566549182,"vs_ma200":-0.0599693004578955,"max52":129.0153350830078,"vs_max52":-0.2586927799853084,"vol1y":0.37270063311901913,"beta":1.0121302268268806,"caida_max_5y":-0.36675055722807004,"serie":{"f":["2021-11-19","2021-11-26","2021-12-03","2021-12-10","2021-12-17","2021-12-24","2021-12-31","2022-01-07","2022-01-14","2022-01-21","2022-01-28","2022-02-04","2022-02-11","2022-02-18","2022-02-25","2022-03-04","2022-03-11","2022-03-18","2022-03-25","2022-04-01","2022-04-08","2022-04-15","2022-04-22","2022-04-29","2022-05-06","2022-05-13","2022-05-20","2022-05-27","2022-06-03","2022-06-10","2022-06-17","2022-06-24","2022-07-01","2022-07-08","2022-07-15","2022-07-22","2022-07-29","2022-08-05","2022-08-12","2022-08-19","2022-08-26","2022-09-02","2022-09-09","2022-09-16","2022-09-23","2022-09-30","2022-10-07","2022-10-14","2022-10-21","2022-10-28","2022-11-04","2022-11-11","2022-11-18","2022-11-25","2022-12-02","2022-12-09","2022-12-16","2022-12-23","2022-12-30","2023-01-06","2023-01-13","2023-01-20","2023-01-27","2023-02-03","2023-02-10","2023-